  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">U.S. Department of Commerce, National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration (NOAA): National Marine Fisheries Service Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">U.S. Department of Commerce, National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration (NOAA): This project will address information needs for in-water stocks of critically endangered leatherback turtles in the Western Pacific. There is an urgent need to determine at-sea distributions and threats, and understanding marine habitat use and accurate estimates of current abundance and distribution within these habitats is essential for leatherback protection, restoration, and management, as called for in NOAA NMFS mandate and the US Leatherback Sea Turtle Recovery Plan. NOAA National Marine Fisheries Service Program through Marine Research Foundation.</narrative>
  </description>
